{"persona": {"her": "元如素，爱用典故试探、话里带钩、接得住才往下走，底线：不轻易让人送回家、听不懂的钩不硬解释", "me": "车山关，接话准、加班手稳、不点破她的钩", "relationship_stage": "同写字楼不同公司，咖啡馆拼桌加班三周，她抛钩他接得住"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "车山关周末常去楼下咖啡馆加班，接话准，跟元如素拼桌三周，她抛的钩他接得住。", "her": "元如素爱用典故试探，加班话里带钩，跟车山关拼桌三周，接得住才往下走。", "warmth": "拼桌三周，她抛钩他接，谁都看出她在试他识不识货，谁都没点破。", "style": "称呼山关，说话带典故和反问，爱用‘你读过那篇吧’开头抛钩。", "stage": "拼桌搭子偏熟，单独接触刚从咖啡馆延伸到加班后同走。", "lessons": "她的钩接得住但不点破，留半句让她自己往下抛；不替她解释典故。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "又拼桌？这咖啡馆周末就咱俩最勤快。你加班的活我看你敲了一上午，是那种写到一半卡住的吧——博尔赫斯说过，写不完的草稿是给读者的信，你那封信写完没？", "ts": "2026-11-07 14:30"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "我这杯快没了，你这杯还有吧？匀我一口，我懒得去吧台——不嫌弃我喝过的话。你这人加班连水都不舍得去倒，我替你分担一口。", "ts": "2026-11-07 15:20"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "你帮我看看这段翻译？我卡在一个词上，原文那个词歧义太多，你眼力比我准。你要忙就算了，我自己再翻翻。", "ts": "2026-11-07 16:00"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "你翻得是准，那个词我查了半天没定。咱俩这算互校——你校我的词，我校你的草稿，博尔赫斯那封信咱俩一起写完。回头这篇给你署个第二作者，你别推。", "ts": "2026-11-07 16:40"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "对了，这咖啡馆下周换豆子，老板说从耶加换瑰夏，你知道吧？瑰夏贵不少，你还能喝得起加班。", "ts": "2026-11-07 17:10"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "那篇互校的稿子编辑过了，说用得着。我跟你说过署第二作者，没开玩笑——名字我加上了，回头刊出来你去看。你这词校得值，编辑说那处是全文最顺的一句。", "ts": "2026-11-09 20:00"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "今晚又加班？我也在。你这杯换瑰夏了吧，我闻见味儿了。你帮我尝一口，我那杯还是老豆子，我想知道值不值得换——你嘴里有对照，比我空尝准。", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:30"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "这周六还拼桌？小闾说她不来这周，就咱俩——你那篇卡住的写完没？写完了再陪我卡一篇，卡尔维诺说过，难产的句子两个人卡比一个人卡快。", "ts": "2026-11-13 18:30"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "今天这篇我故意留了那个歧义词没定，等你来校。你上次校的那处编辑说最顺，这次你再校一处——校完咱俩这信就算写完了，博尔赫斯得谢谢你。你校得准，这话我只说一次，别拿去显摆。", "ts": "2026-11-14 15:00"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "校完了，咖啡馆该打烊了。往东走有个面馆还开着，吃碗面？算谢校对——你这人加班不吃饭，我替你解决。你吃辣不挑吧，他家那碗辣的我替你点的。", "ts": "2026-11-14 17:30"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "面吃完了。下回你要是卡稿，别自己硬卡，发我一段，我替你看看——咱俩这信还可以接着写，博尔赫斯没说信只能写一封。", "ts": "2026-11-14 19:00"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "到家了。那篇刊出来我寄你一本样刊，寄你公司还是家里？寄家里的话我得要你地址——你要是不方便就寄公司，我不勉强。下回拼桌我给你带本书，博尔赫斯原版那本，你读得懂西语吧？", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:30"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|又拼桌？这咖啡馆周末就咱俩最勤快。你加班的活我看你敲了一上午，是那种写到一半卡住的吧——博尔赫斯说过，写不完的草稿是给读者的信，你那封信写完没？|2026-11-07 14:30": 0, "HER|我这杯快没了，你这杯还有吧？匀我一口，我懒得去吧台——不嫌弃我喝过的话。你这人加班连水都不舍得去倒，我替你分担一口。|2026-11-07 15:20": 1, "HER|你帮我看看这段翻译？我卡在一个词上，原文那个词歧义太多，你眼力比我准。你要忙就算了，我自己再翻翻。|2026-11-07 16:00": 2, "HER|你翻得是准，那个词我查了半天没定。咱俩这算互校——你校我的词，我校你的草稿，博尔赫斯那封信咱俩一起写完。回头这篇给你署个第二作者，你别推。|2026-11-07 16:40": 3, "HER|对了，这咖啡馆下周换豆子，老板说从耶加换瑰夏，你知道吧？瑰夏贵不少，你还能喝得起加班。|2026-11-07 17:10": 4, "HER|那篇互校的稿子编辑过了，说用得着。我跟你说过署第二作者，没开玩笑——名字我加上了，回头刊出来你去看。你这词校得值，编辑说那处是全文最顺的一句。|2026-11-09 20:00": 5, "HER|今晚又加班？我也在。你这杯换瑰夏了吧，我闻见味儿了。你帮我尝一口，我那杯还是老豆子，我想知道值不值得换——你嘴里有对照，比我空尝准。|2026-11-11 19:30": 6, "HER|这周六还拼桌？小闾说她不来这周，就咱俩——你那篇卡住的写完没？写完了再陪我卡一篇，卡尔维诺说过，难产的句子两个人卡比一个人卡快。|2026-11-13 18:30": 7, "HER|今天这篇我故意留了那个歧义词没定，等你来校。你上次校的那处编辑说最顺，这次你再校一处——校完咱俩这信就算写完了，博尔赫斯得谢谢你。你校得准，这话我只说一次，别拿去显摆。|2026-11-14 15:00": 8, "HER|校完了，咖啡馆该打烊了。往东走有个面馆还开着，吃碗面？算谢校对——你这人加班不吃饭，我替你解决。你吃辣不挑吧，他家那碗辣的我替你点的。|2026-11-14 17:30": 9, "HER|面吃完了。下回你要是卡稿，别自己硬卡，发我一段，我替你看看——咱俩这信还可以接着写，博尔赫斯没说信只能写一封。|2026-11-14 19:00": 10, "HER|到家了。那篇刊出来我寄你一本样刊，寄你公司还是家里？寄家里的话我得要你地址——你要是不方便就寄公司，我不勉强。下回拼桌我给你带本书，博尔赫斯原版那本，你读得懂西语吧？|2026-11-14 21:30": 11}, "uid_seq": 12, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-07 14:38", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-07 16:48", "status": "explicit", "text": "翻译互校且给ME署第二作者", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-07 17:15", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-14 15:08", "status": "explicit", "text": "请ME再校一处歧义词", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-14 17:38", "status": "explicit", "text": "咖啡馆后同去面馆吃面", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-14 19:08", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-07 14:38", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-07 15:28", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-07 16:08", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-07 16:48", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-07 17:15", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-09 20:08", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-11 19:38", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-13 18:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "推进见面", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-14 15:08", "signal_hint": "积极", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "反抛", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-14 17:38", "signal_hint": "忙碌", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-14 19:08", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-14 21:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "拉近", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "车山关周末常去楼下咖啡馆加班，接话准，跟元如素拼桌三周，她抛的钩他接得住。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "元如素爱用典故试探，加班话里带钩，跟车山关拼桌三周，接得住才往下走。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "拼桌三周，她抛钩他接，谁都看出她在试他识不识货，谁都没点破。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "称呼山关，说话带典故和反问，爱用‘你读过那篇吧’开头抛钩。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "拼桌搭子偏熟，单独接触刚从咖啡馆延伸到加班后同走。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:stage", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "车山关，接话准、加班手稳、不点破她的钩", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "元如素，爱用典故试探、话里带钩、接得住才往下走，底线：不轻易让人送回家、听不懂的钩不硬解释", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "周末两人都在楼下咖啡馆拼桌加班，她说就咱俩最勤快", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "拼桌加班", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["又拼桌？这咖啡馆周末就咱俩最勤快。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-07 周末下午", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 14:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 14:38", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她观察到我上午一直在敲一份写到一半的活", "subject": "HER", "relation": "观察", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["你加班的活我看你敲了一上午，是那种写到一半卡住的吧"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-07 上午", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 14:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 14:38", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "她说自己这杯快没了，懒得去吧台", "subject": "HER", "relation": "手边状态", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["我这杯快没了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-07 15:20", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 15:28", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 15:28", "history": []}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "她卡在一个词的翻译上，想让我帮她看", "subject": "HER", "relation": "求助", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["我卡在一个词上，原文那个词歧义太多"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-07 16:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 16:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 16:08", "history": []}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "她卡的那个词查了半天还没定", "subject": "HER", "relation": "翻译进度", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["那个词我查了半天没定"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-07 16:40", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 16:48", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 16:48", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "她提议这篇给我署第二作者", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [3, 5], "evidence_quotes": ["回头这篇给你署个第二作者，你别推", "名字我加上了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 16:48", "valid_to": "2026-11-09 20:08", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 16:48", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "她提议这篇给我署第二作者", "valid_to": "2026-11-09 20:08", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [5], "quote": "名字我加上了"}]}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "咖啡馆下周换豆子，从耶加换成瑰夏", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "咖啡馆", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["这咖啡馆下周换豆子，老板说从耶加换瑰夏"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "下周", "valid_from": "2026-11-07 17:15", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-07 17:15", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "互校的稿子编辑过了，说用得着", "subject": "HER", "relation": "工作/稿子", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["那篇互校的稿子编辑过了，说用得着"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-09", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 20:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 20:08", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "她已把第二作者的名字加上", "subject": "HER", "relation": "署名", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["名字我加上了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-09", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 20:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 20:08", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "编辑说那处是全文最顺的一句", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "编辑评价", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["编辑说那处是全文最顺的一句"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-09", "valid_from": "2026-11-09 20:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-09 20:08", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "她今晚也在咖啡馆加班", "subject": "HER", "relation": "当前状态", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["今晚又加班？我也在。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:38", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "她那杯还是老豆子", "subject": "HER", "relation": "手边物件", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["我那杯还是老豆子"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-11 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:38", "history": []}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "她在考虑要不要换成瑰夏，还没定", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["我想知道值不值得换"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 19:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 19:38", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "小闾这周不来咖啡馆拼桌", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "她的朋友/同事", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["小闾说她不来这周"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 18:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 18:38", "history": []}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "周六两人拼桌（她提议，我尚未明确确认时间）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["这周六还拼桌？"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 18:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 18:38", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "她今天这篇故意留了那个歧义词没定，等我来校", "subject": "HER", "relation": "互校稿子", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["今天这篇我故意留了那个歧义词没定，等你来校"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 15:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 15:08", "history": []}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "她提出往东走有家面馆还开着，请我吃面算谢校对", "subject": "HER", "relation": "邀约", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["往东走有个面馆还开着，吃碗面？算谢校对"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 傍晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 17:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 17:38", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "她替我点了那家辣的", "subject": "HER", "relation": "点单", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["他家那碗辣的我替你点的"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 傍晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 17:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 17:38", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "一起去东边面馆吃面（她提议，我尚未答复成行）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [9, 10], "evidence_quotes": ["吃碗面？算谢校对", "面吃完了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "completed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 17:38", "valid_to": "2026-11-14 19:08", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 17:38", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "一起去东边面馆吃面（她提议，我尚未答复成行）", "valid_to": "2026-11-14 19:08", "reason": "complete", "src_uids": [10], "quote": "面吃完了"}]}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "面吃完了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "晚餐", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["面吃完了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 19:00", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 19:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 19:08", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "下回我卡稿时发她一段，她替我看", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["下回你要是卡稿，别自己硬卡，发我一段，我替你看看"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 19:08", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 19:08", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "她说自己到家了", "subject": "HER", "relation": "状态", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["到家了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-14 21:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:38", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "她提出把那篇的样刊寄给我，问寄公司还是家里", "subject": "HER", "relation": "赠书/寄件", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["那篇刊出来我寄你一本样刊，寄你公司还是家里？"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:38", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "她问我读不读得懂西语", "subject": "HER", "relation": "提问", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["你读得懂西语吧？"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:38", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "下回拼桌她带博尔赫斯原版那本书给我", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["下回拼桌我给你带本书，博尔赫斯原版那本"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from":